{"data":[{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2029843644346421698","created_at":"2026-03-06T08:56:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2029843644346421698"],"id":"2029843644346421698","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":125001,"like_count":97,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":41,"retweet_count":0},"text":"听说openclaw 是开源版的onlyfans，可以直接扒拉我在Onlyfans 的付费小视频，你们去试试吧，可以的话告诉我一下","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2029843644346421698"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2029829834411757890","created_at":"2026-03-06T08:01:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2029829834411757890"],"id":"2029829834411757890","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":46350,"like_count":62,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"text":"生命从来不曾离开过孤独而独立存在。\n无论是我们出生、我们成长、我们相爱，还是我们成功失败，直到最后的最后，孤独犹如影子一样存在于生命一隅。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2029829834411757890"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2029134179724832946","created_at":"2026-03-04T09:57:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2029134179724832946"],"id":"2029134179724832946","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":71523,"like_count":43,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天各位交了多少军费了 https://t.co/0WLi09Pdqy","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2029134179724832946"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2029040853252272205","created_at":"2026-03-04T03:46:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2029040853252272205"],"id":"2029040853252272205","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":133017,"like_count":255,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":215,"retweet_count":2},"text":"在去惠州的高铁上，旁边的小哥在刷推特，主页还看到我的头像了，我要不要告诉他真人就坐他旁边…","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2029040853252272205"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2028857024453435813","created_at":"2026-03-03T15:36:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028857024453435813"],"id":"2028857024453435813","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":138370,"like_count":165,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":124,"retweet_count":0},"text":"惠州今天在推特跟小红书都上热搜了，好火哦，我想看看有多少推友在广东惠州，麻烦举个小手👋","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2028857024453435813"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2028451498615824448","created_at":"2026-03-02T12:44:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028451498615824448"],"id":"2028451498615824448","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":104786,"like_count":106,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":36,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今年推特是不是开放黄推了？刚才刷着刷着中东局势突然duang的一下蹦出一个超大的狙……好违和🥹","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2028451498615824448"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2027668885147967842","created_at":"2026-02-28T08:55:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2027668885147967842"],"id":"2027668885147967842","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":56291,"like_count":40,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"上来问一下推特币圈的朋友：现在从传统金融行业跳槽到web3，做tokenazation，坐标香港。有人说这等同于是49年入国军，可是香港传统金融中没什么增长点，RWA被叫停了，DCM ECM是稳定可以做，但护城河又很深……","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2027668885147967842"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2026261262968250500","created_at":"2026-02-24T11:41:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2026261262968250500"],"id":"2026261262968250500","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":62081,"like_count":86,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"开工大吉🍊🍊🍊","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2026261262968250500"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2023381979367088336","created_at":"2026-02-16T13:00:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2023381979367088336"],"id":"2023381979367088336","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":67589,"like_count":105,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":0},"text":"除夕夜翻墙出来聊聊space？","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2023381979367088336"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2022124490336219613","created_at":"2026-02-13T01:43:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2022124490336219613"],"id":"2022124490336219613","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"text":"早会上，和一位执掌律所数十年的管理合伙人闲聊。她说，自己现在每天都要花好几个小时咨询AI法律问题，感觉就像免费雇了一个法律团队。\n\n而事实也的确如此：如今的AI早已能游刃有余地通读厚厚合同并挑刺修改，搜罗资本市场案例，撰写尽调报告，甚至还能搭建复杂财务模型，输出份量十足的研报。一想到自己当年跟FA们没日没夜蹲printer盯着招股书一页页修改圈数，赶着催命般的DDL出意见书，通宵达旦咖啡灌到反胃……真是百感交集一言难尽。\n\n如果硬要说，像投行律师会计这些中介如今还有什么不可替代的价值，大概也就剩下两样了：敬酒时迎来送往的那个掮客，和那个万一出事就得第一个出来背锅的签字。"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":29,"impression_count":83993,"like_count":131,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":7},"text":"早会上，和一位执掌律所数十年的管理合伙人闲聊。她说，自己现在每天都要花好几个小时咨询AI法律问题，感觉就像免费雇了一个法律团队。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2022124490336219613"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2021915102879134008","created_at":"2026-02-12T11:51:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2021915102879134008"],"id":"2021915102879134008","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":135,"impression_count":1021395,"like_count":4002,"quote_count":13,"reply_count":281,"retweet_count":96},"text":"每天都上推特只看黄的应该是目前中国体感幸福最强的一个群体。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2021915102879134008"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2021550659712270709","created_at":"2026-02-11T11:43:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2021550659712270709"],"id":"2021550659712270709","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":298,"impression_count":274469,"like_count":794,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":124,"retweet_count":42},"text":"有多少人认真看完今天小陆师傅那篇推文《2026年，我眼中的中国经济》的？篇幅很长其实就说一句话：除了少数几个赛道里的头部公司和少数几个靠政策吃饭的，绝大部分中国人的实际购买力与幸福体感，已经被名义GDP增速彻底甩开到另一个次元了。翻墙之后真的越来越悲观了。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2021550659712270709"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2021239518074949664","created_at":"2026-02-10T15:07:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2021239518074949664"],"id":"2021239518074949664","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1433,"impression_count":583293,"like_count":1839,"quote_count":12,"reply_count":166,"retweet_count":226},"text":"我的闺蜜，是一个作家，2025年年入千万。她告诉我，她用Claude起草情节框架，用Grok润色对话，用NovelAI生成整章内容，包括那些情色的部分。是的，连床戏都是AI写的。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2021239518074949664"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2020849696416141375","created_at":"2026-02-09T13:18:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2020849696416141375"],"id":"2020849696416141375","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":269,"impression_count":642362,"like_count":3548,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":123,"retweet_count":147},"text":"这么多年来，罗老师不为名利，并且已经很懂得走钢丝的艺术了，可是，他仍然躲不过。 https://t.co/z7TE8TywWF","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2020849696416141375"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2020493379612938372","created_at":"2026-02-08T13:42:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2020493379612938372"],"id":"2020493379612938372","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":322,"impression_count":1910247,"like_count":2097,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":221,"retweet_count":35},"text":"关注的网黄停更了，多半就是进去了\n停更一段时间后删推了，多半就是取保候审了\n你们看看自己的关注列表就知道","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2020493379612938372"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2019756746776940693","created_at":"2026-02-06T12:55:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2019756746776940693"],"id":"2019756746776940693","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":79823,"like_count":90,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":38,"retweet_count":3},"text":"黄金跌\n白银跌\n房价跌\n比特币跌\n性欲也都快跌没了\n还有什么会涨的吗？","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2019756746776940693"},{"article":{"title":"被富豪物化：是女孩内在渴望的愉悦，还是隐秘的剥削陷阱？"},"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2019409466832097370","created_at":"2026-02-05T13:55:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2019409466832097370"],"id":"2019409466832097370","lang":"zxx","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":54,"impression_count":92200,"like_count":60,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":3},"text":"https://t.co/CcyvEfJ9vP","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2019409466832097370"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2016912506514808844","created_at":"2026-01-29T16:33:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2016912506514808844"],"id":"2016912506514808844","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":58856,"like_count":56,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我發誓這是我年前的最後一次加班","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2016912506514808844"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2016508647250301342","created_at":"2026-01-28T13:48:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2016508647250301342"],"id":"2016508647250301342","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":1139,"id":"1390560341227020291","start":1126,"username":"hongkongdoll"}]},"text":"开了蓝v之后，应该是第一次写长文吧。这次的有感而发，是看了hongkong doll那篇文章。我刷到最后一行，手指停在屏幕上半天没动，心里像被什么东西重重压住。\n\n她把那段往事剖得血淋淋：第一个男人，用纯爱两个字把她骗进镜头前，说好一起追梦，结果转身就把她当成最赚钱的机器，榨干了青春、榨干了信任；第二个男人，表面温柔得像救赎，实际却用控制和冷暴力把她逼到悬崖边——她写到自己站在高楼天台，风吹得头发乱飞，脑子里只剩结束一切的念头。那一刻，我仿佛看见她整个人被撕成两半：一半是想活下去的倔强，一半是被爱人亲手推向深渊的绝望。\n\n事业和感情搅在一起，就像把心脏和钱包缝在同一条线上。女人太容易在并肩作战时动心，以为并肩就是相守，以为他给的机会是爱，其实只是他需要一个最听话最能帮他赚钱的女人。一旦他不需要了，或者找到更新的资源，你就被扔进垃圾桶，还要被钉上忘恩负义的标签。想走的时候已经走不了，合同、流量、舆论、共同的圈子，全都像锁链，把你和伤害你的人死死绑在一起。撕扯几年，血肉模糊，才换来一个狼狈的自由。\n\n我看评论区里，有人说这两个男人是hongkong doll的贵人？\n\n嗯，贵人，是的。没有他们的奉献、没有那些被拍下的画面、被炒起的绯闻、被消费的私生活，她不会有今天铺天盖地的流量。可那流量是建立在她的伤口上的啊，每一次热搜，都是旧伤被重新撕开一次。命里的贵人跟命里最毒的劫，从来就不是对立，而是同一把刀。刀背把你推上高处，刀刃却同时割开你的喉咙。没有那些差点要了她命的夜晚，就没有今天站在聚光灯下的她。可这代价，谁愿意付第二次？\n\n我看着看着，眼泪就掉下来了。因为我太懂了。\n\n我前夫也是这样的人。当年我们一起创业，他是我唯一的依靠，我把全部的赌注都押在他身上，怀着孩子还熬夜帮他谈客户，产后抑郁最重的时候还硬撑着陪他应酬。我以为我们是在一起打江山，其实他只是需要一个既能生孩子又能帮他赚钱的女人。后来生意做大了，他在外头有了人，回来却还理直气壮地说我给你这一切，你还有什么不满足。离婚那天，我抱着孩子坐在法庭的长椅上，感觉整个人都被掏空了，像行尸走肉。那些年，我差点也走到天台边缘，幸好孩子的一句妈妈，把我拉了回来。\n\n现在，我一个人带孩子，一个人工作，一个人面对所有风雨。回过头看，那段婚姻是我的劫，也是我的贵人。没有那场支离破碎的崩塌，我永远学不会把命运握在自己手里。\n\n男人可以是助推器，可以是伯乐，但绝不能是你全部的天。但女人同时也要接受一个事实：把事业和感情绑在一起，注定要用血泪换成长。贵人会走，劫难会过，最后能陪你走到终点的，只有被伤得千疮百孔却依旧选择站起来的自己。\n\n先随便写到这里吧，也谢谢hongkong doll @hongkongdoll 文章的这个话题，谢谢你把最丑陋的伤疤掀开给我们看。你疼，我们也疼，但疼过之后，我们都得学会飞。"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":54,"impression_count":125385,"like_count":242,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":52,"retweet_count":10},"text":"开了蓝v之后，应该是第一次写长文吧。这次的有感而发，是看了hongkong doll那篇文章。我刷到最后一行，手指停在屏幕上半天没动，心里像被什么东西重重压住。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2016508647250301342"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2015082622008041671","created_at":"2026-01-24T15:21:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2015082622008041671"],"id":"2015082622008041671","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":103099,"like_count":131,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":162,"retweet_count":0},"text":"老规矩，中国⚽️赢了我评论区抽粉丝跟我炒菜","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2015082622008041671"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2013739312295080379","created_at":"2026-01-20T22:24:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2013739312295080379"],"id":"2013739312295080379","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":77701,"like_count":109,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我回来了\n闺蜜生了\n手机丢了","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2013739312295080379"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2012809357319389630","created_at":"2026-01-18T08:48:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2012809357319389630"],"id":"2012809357319389630","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":69235,"like_count":80,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":54,"retweet_count":0},"text":"顺应一下老马的号召，我也是一个有蓝勾勾的女人了","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/2012809357319389630"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"2012727232595390856","created_at":"2026-01-18T03:22:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2012727232595390856"],"id":"2012727232595390856","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":243682,"like_count":235,"quote_count":1